    </div>
    <div class="block-config">
        <div class="ttl-config">Filter by Members</div>
        <div class="list-box">
            <div class="box">
                <label>All Members</label>
                <p>Ticket of all members will be monitored<br />New members will be include automatically.</p>
                <label class="bottom">
                    <input type="radio" name="member" value="" />
                    <span></span>
                </label>
            </div>
            <div class="box">
                <label>specific Members</label>
                <p>
                    Specific members can be added manually or selected from monitored fist.<br />Selecting specific a member may be obsolete once member closed.
                </p>
                <label class="bottom">
                    <input type="radio" name="member" value="" checked />
